"GPIO lease/gate objects. These are not total Platform storage. An inlined or"
" unretained helper without a separate function symbol is not assigned zero "
"cost. These observations describe exact linked selections; different "
"backends, capacities or routes are not comparable optimization percentages. "
"No cycles, interrupt blackout time or WCET was measured."

